  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.GOMapOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to GOMap -- a geo-location and augmented reality mapping engine providing the spatial layer for placing OASIS entities on real-world maps and AR overlays. Powers the Our World and One World geo-spatial visualisation layers. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Integrate the qualified GOMap public reader into the scoped WEB4 candidate (1b7389d)\n- Integrate verified GOMap CQL route provenance (8e3f15e)\n- Integrate verified GOMap public routing contract (922321a)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Maps/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.GOMapOASIS",
